Scripts/Migration
=================

Three helpers the build and the test suite still use. The source migration that
produced Compiler/'s Stage 1 syntax is not part of this repository.

  eval_hash.py           compute_hash(): the same hash as Compiler/Support/EvalHash.k.
                         Scripts/gen_diag.py uses it to give each diagnostic code its
                         DiagID value.
  const_value_params.py  rewrites `<const N: T>` to `<eval N: T>`. Tests/CLI/Migration/
                         const_value_params.k checks it against the compiler's own S001E
                         fix-it, so the two cannot drift apart.
  kairo_lex.py           the shared lexer-lite both import: decides which bytes of a .k
                         file are code (not comments, strings or inline "c++").
